license: MIT

abstract: >
  Lean 4 formalization of the neutral structural substrate of Structural
  Explainability. The theory provides an abstract propositional language,
  commitment theories and consequence, framework and referent structures,
  substrate commitments, attribution and interpretation predicates,
  framework-relative properties, and formal conditions for interpretive
  non-commitment, extension stability, and neutrality by design.

